/// Suppliers contains supplier information used to analyze products and sales by supplier. Each row represents one supplier record. Supplier Key is the surrogate key used for relationships with Products and is a technical relationship key. Supplier ID is the business identifier of the supplier from the source system. The table contains supplier company, contact, address, geographic, and communication information where available. Supplier attributes can be used to group and filter products and evaluate sales performance associated with products supplied by each supplier. Supplier is related to Products, and sales analysis by supplier should be performed through the Products dimension and Sales fact table.
table Suppliers
	lineageTag: 242cb7b9-a769-4b4b-a0a3-83f9702971ee
	sourceLineageTag: [gold].[dim_supplier]

